 0.035)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgb(0 0 0 / 0.45)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="M16.5 16.5L21 21"></path></svg><span class="truncate text-[14px]" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.8)">Which suppliers changed owner this year?</span></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white" style="width:24px;height:24px;border:1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 0.12)"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="14" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ftinyfish-logo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ftinyfish-logo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75"/></span><span class="text-[14px]" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.55)"><span class="font-medium" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.85)">TinyFish</span> read 214 pages</span></span><p class="text-[16px] font-medium leading-6" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9)">Two changed owner: <span style="color:#bf5000">Northwind</span> and <span style="color:#bf5000">Kestrel</span>.</p><div class="flex flex-col text-[14px]"><span class="py-2" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.55);border-top:1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 0.07)">companieshouse.gov.uk</span><span class="py-2" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.55);border-top:1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 0.07)">sec.gov</span><span class="py-2" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.55);border-top:1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 0.07)">bloomberg.com</span><span class="py-2" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.55);border-top:1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 0.07)">reuters.com</span><span class="py-2" style="color:rgb(0 0 0 / 0.55);border-top:1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 0.07)">ft.com</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[440px]"></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col gap-7 overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] px-6 pt-7 sm:px-8 sm:pt-8 xm-fade" style="background:#F5F5F4;--d:390ms"><div class="relative flex flex-co